A pilot exploring refillable glass for a famous beer brands's Bodega beer: a machine to wash bottles on-site at the bar itself, so they could be refilled and sold direct-to-consumer instead of discarded after one use. The pilot was done using a loyalty tracking system.

I built the machine used in the bar during the pilot. The prototype taught us that an in-bar washing machine doesn't make sense operationally and a collect-and-wash model works better.

*Note : Project is under NDA and further details cannot be shared.*
